   Let=E2=80=99s end with the experience of Xu Ming, the 3AM alarm-setter. =
*Renwu*
   relays: *The most dramatic scene occurred one Saturday at the soccer
   practice field. Xu Ming, not particularly interested in her son=E2=80=99=
s soccer
   playing, was scrolling through her phone out of boredom when her son, wh=
o
   had just finished drinking water, stood in front of her, his face flushe=
d
   and his expression serious. After a brief standoff, instead of complaini=
ng
   in Chinese, he looked directly at his mother and said in clear, fluent
   English, =E2=80=9CYou should look at me, not at your phone.=E2=80=9D Thi=
s sudden
   =E2=80=9Caccusation=E2=80=9D didn=E2=80=99t embarrass Xu Ming; instead, =
it made her feel quite
   gratified. =E2=80=9CAt that moment, I knew in my heart that this had wor=
